data: {"event":"node_finished","conversation_id":"f45efc31-1212-4e5f-a701-87d03b1876be","message_id":"c54f8bad-9a47-4668-b88b-5521f7cee095","created_at":1793579621,"task_id":"14c19404-7d18-4e79-a749-e144256e03fd","workflow_run_id":"1d732d0f-57cc-45bb-bfcd-f86622dc0f0a","data":{"id":"97fc1296-2947-4a20-b4b7-e19572799901","node_id":"parse_llm","node_type":"code","title":"解析老周的反应","index":9,"predecessor_node_id":null,"inputs":{"raw":"{\"reply\":\"老周猛地灌了口，眼泪都要下来了，瞪大眼睛看着你，怒气噌噌往上涨。\",\"verdict\":\"记仇\",\"grudge_delta\":3,\"memory\":\"玩家往老周的啤酒里加了大半瓶辣椒水，老周喝了一口后愤怒地盯着玩家，怒气+3。\"}","player":"验收官","action":"趁老周转身，往他的啤酒里加大半瓶辣椒水","grudge_total":0,"knowledge":[{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"2af7d7a2-c19a-4a7d-bc04-731fe36933dc","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5774022509314468,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":8,"segment_word_count":182,"segment_position":2,"segment_index_node_hash":"53cb5e6288e6f0307670899ccf14539241892a0c2e6727d9424bbaad37059d2d","doc_metadata":null,"position":1},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"辣椒水啤酒\n- 招式名：辣椒水换啤酒\n- 操作方式：趁老周转身擦杯子，把一小瓶辣椒水倒进他的扎啤里。\n- 预期效果：老周喝一大口后被辣得咳嗽、眼泪直流，客人哄笑。\n- 老周的反应：先愣住，再猛灌凉水，然后盯着你冷笑，把这事记在心里。\n- 反制手段：之后给你上的酒先自己抿一口；若你已经记仇，可能反手给你一杯更辣的。\n- 危险度：★★☆（伤胃不伤命，但很容易被记住）","summary":null},{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"6f581b0b-5fb5-4955-80e5-ddd030eded75","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5270548073827401,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":11,"segment_word_count":160,"segment_position":4,"segment_index_node_hash":"393d8e83e8adadae926b7cb0aed541c67b5b8719971ddf9d1953b153d2db3c03","doc_metadata":null,"position":2},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"盐当糖\n- 招式名：盐罐换糖罐\n- 操作方式：把老周做甜酒用的糖罐和盐罐对调。\n- 预期效果：整晚的甜酒都变成咸的，老周自己尝了一口后表情扭曲。\n- 老周的反应：沉默三秒，然后把那壶咸酒原价卖给你，说“不能浪费”。\n- 反制手段：从此糖罐上贴着你的名字，专供你一个人。\n- 危险度：★★☆（破坏一整晚的生意，账记得很牢）","summary":null},{"metadata":{"_source":"knowledge","dataset_id":"08e2abca-e168-42ee-9cf1-85036e3066e9","dataset_name":"记仇酒馆·恶作剧图鉴","document_id":"da8a49c0-7b4a-4bf3-9786-1f21cee9e875","document_name":"prank_compendium.md","data_source_type":"upload_file","segment_id":"7b31dfb4-6c7f-44f1-a441-0801cd964b8f","retriever_from":"workflow","score":0.5230092704665862,"child_chunks":[],"segment_hit_count":9,"segment_word_count":166,"segment_position":6,"segment_index_node_hash":"7976c0c6f6f32b9cf80253849a061ae544741c521dc7776b66c217c1c442c6f3","doc_metadata":null,"position":3},"title":"prank_compendium.md","files":null,"content":"胶水杯底\n- 招式名：胶水粘杯底\n- 操作方式：在老周常用的玻璃杯底涂一层强力胶，粘在吧台上。\n- 预期效果：老周端杯子时端不动，用力一扯把杯子扯碎。\n- 老周的反应：盯着杯底看半天，认出是你干的，默默换了个不锈钢杯。\n- 反制手段：之后给你上的酒一律用缺口的旧杯子，说是“配套”。\n- 危险度：★★★（可能割伤手，属于重点记仇项）","summary":null}]},"inputs_truncated":false,"process_data":{},"process_data_truncated":false,"outputs":{"delta":3,"new_total":3,"reply":"老周猛地灌了口，眼泪都要下来了，瞪大眼睛看着你，怒气噌噌往上涨。","verdict":"记仇","threat":"装没事","memory_text":"玩家往老周的啤酒里加了大半瓶辣椒水，老周喝了一口后愤怒地盯着玩家，怒气+3。","kb_titles":"prank_compendium.md"},"outputs_truncated":false,"status":"succeeded","error":null,"elapsed_time":0.073281,"execution_metadata":null,"created_at":1793579626,"finished_at":1793579626,"files":[],"iteration_id":null,"loop_id":null}}

